00191 // Backend data stored in io.BackendPlatformUserData to allow support for multiple Dear ImGui contexts
00192 // It is STRONGLY preferred that you use docking branch with multi-viewports (== single Dear ImGui context + multiple windows) instead of multiple Dear ImGui contexts.
00193 // FIXME: multi-context support is not well tested and probably dysfunctional in this backend.
00194 // - Because glfwPollEvents() process all windows and some events may be called outside of it, you will need to register your own callbacks
00195 //   (passing install_callbacks=false in ImGui_ImplGlfw_InitXXX functions), set the current dear imgui context and then call our callbacks.
00196 // - Otherwise we may need to store a GLFWWindow* -> ImGuiContext* map and handle this in the backend, adding a little bit of extra complexity to it.
00197 // FIXME: some shared resources (mouse cursor shape, gamepad) are mishandled when using multi-context.
00198 static ImGui_ImplGlfw_Data* ImGui_ImplGlfw_GetBackendData()
00199 {
00200     return ImGui::GetCurrentContext() ? (ImGui_ImplGlfw_Data*)ImGui::GetIO().BackendPlatformUserData : nullptr;
00201 }
00202 
